#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:5
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The Kipi acquire images plugin is a tool to scan images using a flat "
#| "scanner."
msgid ""
"The Acquire Images tool is dedicated to scan images using a flat scanner."
msgstr ""
"Kipi dodatak za nabavljanje slika je alat koji skenira slike koristeći "
"fiksni skener."

#. Tag: keyword
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "Flat scanner"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:15
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Acquire Images"
msgid "Acquire Images Tool"
msgstr "Dohvatanje slika"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:17
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This plugin can be used to scan images using a flat scanner. The plugin "
#| "uses libksane, a &kde; interface for SANE library to control flat "
#| "scanners."
msgid ""
"This tool can be used to scan images using a flat scanner. The tool uses "
"libksane, an interface for SANE library to control flat scanners."
msgstr ""
"Dodatak može biti upotrebljen da skenira slike koristeći fiksni skener. "
"Dodatak koristi libksane, &kde; interface za SANE bibilioteku za "
"kontrolisanje fiksnih skenera."

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:19
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "It can save images in all the formats supported by &kde;. For example the "
#| "following formats:"
msgid ""
"It can save images in all main image containers, as for example the "
"following formats:"
msgstr ""
"Može snimiti slike u svim formatima podržanim od strane &kde;. Na primjer "
"sljedeće formate:"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "png (8 and 16 bits per color)"
msgstr "png (8 i 16 bita po boji)"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "jpeg, jpg, jpeg 2000"
msgstr "jpeg, jpg, jpeg 2000"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid "tiff"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can check the status of your scanner support from the SANE project "
"website by entering the information on this search page: <ulink url=\"http://"
"www.sane-project.org/cgi-bin/driver.pl\">http://www.sane-project.org/cgi-bin/"
"driver.pl</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Možete provjeriti status vašeg skenera podržanog od strane SANE projekat "
"internet stranice unošenjem informacija na ovoj stranici za pretraživanje: "
"<ulink url=\"http://www.sane-project.org/cgi-bin/driver.pl\">http://www.sane-"
"project.org/cgi-bin/driver.pl</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scanner Selection"
msgstr "Izbor skenera"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the selected scanner cannot be opened or if no default scanner is "
"provided, a scanner selection dialog is opened."
msgstr ""
"Ako trenutni selektovarni skener ne može biti otvoren ili nije podržan "
"defaultni skener, dijalog izbora skenera će biti otvoren."

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:40
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The user can choose the scanner to be used and press <guibutton>OK</"
#| "guibutton> to open the scanner. Pressing <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> "
#| "will cause the plugin to exit."
msgid ""
"The user can choose the scanner to be used and press <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton> to open the scanner. Pressing <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> will "
"cause the tool to exit."
msgstr ""
"Korisnik može izabrati skener koji će biti korišten i pritisnuti "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> da otvori skener. Klikom na <guibutton>Cancel</"
"guibutton> će izaći iz dodatka."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>No scanner found</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Nije pronađen nijedan skener</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>No scanner found</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Nije pronađen nijedan skener</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In case no devices were found, maybe because the scanner is not plugged in "
"or switched off, correct that. Then the <guibutton>Reload device list</"
"guibutton> can be used to reload the list of scanners."
msgstr ""
"Ako nije pronađen nijedan uređaj, jer skener nije priključen ili upaljen, "
"popravite to. Onda možete koristiti <guibutton>Ponovo učitaj listu uređaja</"
"guibutton> za ponovno učitavanje liste skenera."

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:60
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Not all drivers/backends support this feature. In that case quit the "
#| "plugin, connect your scanner and restart the application."
msgid ""
"Not all drivers/backends support this feature. In that case quit the tool, "
"connect your scanner and restart the application."
msgstr ""
"Ne podržavaju svi drajveri / sistemski ovu funkciju. U tom slučaju izađite "
"iz dodatka, povežite skener i ponovo pokrenite aplikaciju."

#. Tag: title
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:67
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Main Window"
msgid "Main Dialog"
msgstr "Glavni Prozor"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:69
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "<screeninfo>Main window</screeninfo>"
msgid "<screeninfo>Main dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Glavni prozor</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:75
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "<phrase>Main window</phrase>"
msgid "<phrase>Main dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Glavni prozor</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:80
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "In the main window, the user has two sets of scan options: "
#| "<guilabel>Basic Options</guilabel> and <guilabel>Scanner Specific "
#| "Options</guilabel>. The <guilabel>Basic Options</guilabel> tab contains "
#| "the most common parameters that the SANE scanner backends provide, while "
#| "the <guilabel>Scanner Specific Options</guilabel> tab contains all the "
#| "options of the backend. The options listed here depend on SANE support "
#| "for your driver: libksane (which the plugin uses) should be able to "
#| "display most of the types of parameters that SANE provides (analog gamma "
#| "tables are not supported at this time)."
msgid ""
"In the main window, the user has two sets of scan options: <guilabel>Basic "
"Options</guilabel> and <guilabel>Scanner Specific Options</guilabel>. The "
"<guilabel>Basic Options</guilabel> tab contains the most common parameters "
"that the SANE scanner backends provide, while the <guilabel>Scanner Specific "
"Options</guilabel> tab contains all the options of the backend. The options "
"listed here depend on SANE support for your driver: libksane (which the tool "
"uses) should be able to display most of the types of parameters that SANE "
"provides (analog gamma tables are not supported at this time)."
msgstr ""
"U glavnom prozoru, korisnik ima dva seta opcija za skeniranje : "
"<guilabel>Osnovne opcije</guilabel> i <guilabel>Specifične skener opcije</"
"guilabel>.  <guilabel>Basic Options</guilabel> tab  sadrži uobičajne "
"parametre koje SANE skener može dati, dok  <guilabel>Specifične skener "
"opcije</guilabel> tab sadrži sve opcije backenda. Opcije izlistane ovdje "
"zavise da li SANE podržava vaš drajver: libksane(koji dodatak koristi) će "
"moći prikazati na ekran većinu tipova parametara koje SANE pruža ( analogni "
"gama tablice nisu podržani u ovom trenutku)."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Scanner Specific Options tab</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Kartica sa posebnim opcijama skenera</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Scanner Specific Options tab</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Kartica sa posebnim opcijama skenera</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:96
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The scanner specific options contains more detailed options of the "
#| "backends. The plugin does not have any special handling for these options."
msgid ""
"The scanner specific options contains more detailed options of the backends. "
"The tool does not have any special handling for these options."
msgstr ""
"Specifične skener opcije sadrže detaljnije opcije o backendu. Dodatak nema "
"nikakvo specijalno rukovanje za ove opcije."

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are satisfied with your settings, you can use the little arrow on the "
"top of the options splitter. When clicked it collapses or expands the "
"options. The collapser can overlap the preview area, but fades away when the "
"mouse cursor moves out of the collapser."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste zadovoljni vašim postavkama, možete korisiti malu strelicu na vrhu "
"djeljitelja opcija. Kada je kliknete skuplja ili proširuje opcije. Širenje "
"može pokriti područje prikaza, ali nestaje čim je kursor miša pomjeren sa "
"strelice."

#. Tag: title
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scanning"
msgstr "Skeniranje"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To scan an image, the user can start with a preview scan and then select the "
"part of the scan area to do the final scan on. The preview scan is started "
"by pressing the preview button."
msgstr ""
"Da skenira fotografiju, korisnik može početi od prikaza skeniranja i "
"odaberite područje skeniranja u krajnjem skeniranju. Prikaz skeniranja se "
"dobije pritiskom prikaz tipke."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The Preview Button</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Tipka za prikaz</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Preview Button</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Tipka za prikaz</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the preview is scanned the area for the final image can be selected."
msgstr "Kada je prikaz skeniran dio za krajnju sliku može biti odabran."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Selection and zoom</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Odabir i povećavanje</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Selection and zoom</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Odabir i povećavanje</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To better select the image the user can zoom in, out, to the current "
"selection or zoom to fit the whole preview to the window."
msgstr ""
"Za bolji odabir slike korisnik može koristiti povećavanje, smanjivanje "
"trenutnog dijela slike ili povećavanje da stane cijelog prozora za prikaz."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The \"zoom to fit\" button</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>\"Povećaj da stane\" tipka</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The \"zoom to fit\" button</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase> \"Povećaj da stane\" tipka</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the image is selected the final image can be acquired by pressing the "
"final scan button."
msgstr ""
"Kada je odabrana fotografija krajnja fotografija može biti stvorena "
"pritiskom na tipku za krajnji odabit."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The final scan button</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Tipka za finalno skeniranje</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The final scan button</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Tipka za krajnji odabir</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid "You will see the progress of the scan."
msgstr "Vidjećete napredak skeniranja."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Scanning in progress</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Skeniranje u toku</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Scanning in progress</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Skeiranje u toku</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scanning Multiple Selections"
msgstr "Skeniranje višestrukih dijelova"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:186
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Sometimes you need only certain parts of an image. Instead of scanning "
#| "the whole picture and then using a graphics application (&eg; "
#| "&kolourpaint;) to save the different image parts into separate files, use "
#| "the plugins multiple selection feature."
msgid ""
"Sometimes you need only certain parts of an image. Instead of scanning the "
"whole picture and then using a graphics application (&eg; &kolourpaint;) to "
"save the different image parts into separate files, use the tool multiple "
"selection feature."
msgstr ""
"Ponekad trebate samo određeni dio slike. Umjesto skeniranja cijele slike i "
"korištenja grafičke aplikacije ( &eg; &kolourpaint;) da bi snimili dio druge "
"slike u različite datoteke, koristite dodatak za osobinu višestruke "
"selekcije."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Multiple Selections</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Višestruki odabir</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Multiple Selections</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Višestruki odabir</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Scan a preview and then use the &LMB; to select the first part of the image "
"in the preview. Hover the selected area with mouse cursor and click on the "
"green <guiicon>+</guiicon> icon to select the area. Selected areas are "
"indicated by a red border. Now select the next parts of the image in the "
"same way."
msgstr ""
"Skenirajte pregled i koristite &LMB; da odaberete prvi dio fotografije u "
"pregledu. Pokrite odabrano područje sa pokazivačem miša i pritisnite zelenu  "
"<guiicon>+</guiicon> ikonu da odaberete područje. Odabrana područja su "
"označena crvenim okvirom. Sada odaberite slijedeće dijelove fotografije na "
"isti način."

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To remove a single selection hover the area with the mouse cursor and click "
"on the red <guiicon>-</guiicon> icon. With <guilabel>Clear Selections</"
"guilabel> from the context menu launched with the &RMB; all selections in a "
"preview can be removed."
msgstr ""
"Da odznačite neki dio fotografje pređite područje pokazivačem miša i "
"pritisnite <guiicon>-</guiicon> ikonu. Sa <guilabel>Poništi odabire</"
"guilabel> iz kontekst menija pokrenutog sa &RMB; svi odabiri u pregledu mogu "
"biti uklonjeni."

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:211
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you placed two separate images or photos on you scanner and started a "
#| "preview the plugin automatically preselect the different areas."
msgid ""
"If you placed two separate images or photos on you scanner and started a "
"preview the tool automatically preselect the different areas."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste stavili dvije različite slike na vašem skeneru i započeli gledanje "
"dodatak će automatski preselektirati različite dijelove."

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:214
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are satisfied with your choice starting the final batch scan of all "
"selections. The selected parts of the image are scanned and saved separately "
"into different files."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste zadovoljni sa izborom započnite finalno batch skeniranje svih "
"selekcija. Selektovani dijelovi slike su skenirani i snimljeni u različite "
"datoteke."

#. Tag: title
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid "Help and Close"
msgstr "Pomoć i Zatvori"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the bottom of the main window you find the <guibutton>Help</guibutton> "
"and <guibutton>Close</guibutton> buttons."
msgstr ""
"Na donjem dijelu glavnog prozora naći ćete <guibutton>Pomoć</guibutton> i "
"<guibutton>Zatvori</guibutton> buttons."

#. Tag: para
#: tool-acquireimages.docbook:224
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The <guibutton>Help</guibutton> button brings up the menu described in "
#| "the section <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Help "
#| "Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals. The <guibutton>Close</guibutton> "
#| "button is used to exit the plugin."
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Help</guibutton> button brings up the menu described in the "
"section <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-help\">Help Menu</"
"ulink>. The <guibutton>Close</guibutton> button is used to exit the tool."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>Pomoć</guibutton> gumb donosi meni opisan u poglavlju <ulink url="
"\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Pomoćni Meni</ulink> u &kde; "
"osnovama. <guibutton>Zatvori</guibutton> gumb će izaći iz dodatka."

